/ Field of a secret setting (secret: true), never filled in. With a stored
/ value it shows an edit icon, and the field is sent only after clicking it:
/ until then the stored value stays, sent blank it is removed. value is only
/ asked whether there is one.
- stored = value.present?
span data-controller='additionals-secret-field'
  - if stored
    span data-additionals-secret-field-target='stored'
      = label_tag tag_name, setting[:label]
      = link_to sprite_icon('edit', l(:button_edit)), '#',
                class: 'icon-only icon-edit',
                data: { action: 'additionals-secret-field#edit' }
  span class=('hidden' if stored) data-additionals-secret-field-target='field'
    = additionals_settings_passwordfield setting[:key],
                                         value: nil,
                                         tag_name:,
                                         label: setting[:label],
                                         required: setting[:required],
                                         disabled: stored,
                                         data: { additionals_secret_field_target: 'input' }
